From 1b841c23812a7d91a181a7bd2c845a330f60e8a5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Van Tran <tetcu@fgorg.vn>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:22:47 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(goals): goals with a number, a deadline, history and
 linked work; Goals page

- feat(goals): goals with a number, a deadline, history and linked work

  Tables goal, goal_value, goal_link (add-only, no foreign keys). API under
  /api/goals: list, get with history, create/update/delete (owner/admin),
  POST values (also agents for script-measured goals), PUT links (projects,
  issues). Health computed server-side: on_track / at_risk / off_track from
  progress against the share of time used, update_due for stale manual
  numbers, needed and actual pace per week.

- feat(goals): Goals page and goal detail on web and desktop

  Sidebar entry Goals (after Projects). List: off track / at risk / on track /
  update due tiles, goal tree with progress, health and pace, measured by and
  linked work; New goal form. Detail: big number, chart of actual values
  against the needed line, enter a value with a note, linked issues, history.
  Core: goals api client methods with zod schemas, queries and mutations.

Patch-Id: goals
